' Deadlines & reminders — see docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-16-deadlines-reminders-design.md

@startuml deadlines-reminders-sequence
title Document deadlines and local reminders (event saved -> reminders -> tap)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Owner
participant "Mobile app" as App
participant "ReminderSync" as Sync
participant "reminderPlan\n(pure)" as Plan
participant "scheduler\n(expo-notifications)" as Sched
participant "Server\nGET /vehicles/{vin}/deadlines" as Api
participant "OS notifications" as Os

== An event is saved (or the app starts, returns to the foreground, or settings change) ==
Owner -> App : save a renewed RCA
App -> Api : POST /vehicles/{vin}/events
App -> App : invalidate timeline(vin)\n(deadlines key sits under it)
App -> Api : GET /vehicles/{vin}/deadlines
Api --> App : six items (status, validUntil, daysLeft, eventId)

== The plan is rebuilt from scratch ==
App -> Sync : deadlines, garage, settings, last tires date
Sync -> Plan : reminderPlan(cars, prefs, now)
Plan --> Sync : reminders at 09:00 local\n(30 / 7 / 1 days + expiry day, tire season,\nfuture only, earliest 60)
alt plan changed and permission granted
  Sync -> Sched : applyPlan(plan)
  Sched -> Os : cancelAllScheduledNotifications
  Sched -> Os : scheduleNotification x N
else permission undetermined and plan not empty
  Sync -> Owner : explanation sheet (once)
  Owner -> Sync : Allow reminders
  Sync -> Os : system permission prompt
end

== Later ==
Os -> Owner : "RCA expires in 7 days"
Owner -> Os : tap
Os -> App : response { vin, kind }
App -> Owner : open Document status for that car
note right of App
  A renewed document has a later validUntil,
  so its old reminders are not in the new plan.
  Sign-out cancels everything.
end note
@enduml

@startuml deadlines-status
title Document status rules (server)
[*] --> NOT_RECORDED : no entry in the group
[*] --> UNKNOWN : current entry, no validUntil (ITP only)
[*] --> VALID : validUntil - today > 30 days
VALID --> EXPIRING : validUntil - today <= 30 days
EXPIRING --> EXPIRED : today > validUntil
@enduml
